#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "That GPU node or GPU does not exist, or is on a device you do not have access to."
msgstr "Iyo node ya GPU cyangwa GPU ntibaho, cyangwa iri ku gikoresho udafitiye uburenganzira."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU data query could not be added to the device. Check that the plugin's templates are installed."
msgstr "Ishakisha ry'amakuru ya GPU ntiryashoboye kongerwa ku gikoresho. Genzura ko inyandikorugero z'umugereka zashyizwemo."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: the node's device was deleted, so the node can only be disabled."
msgstr "Igikoresho: igikoresho cya node cyasibwe, bityo node ishobora guhagarikwa gusa."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: choose an existing Cacti device."
msgstr "Igikoresho: hitamo igikoresho cya Cacti gisanzwe kiriho."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: this device is already a GPU node."
msgstr "Igikoresho: iki gikoresho gisanzwe ari node ya GPU."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was saved."
msgstr "Node ya GPU yabitswe."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node could not be saved."
msgstr "Node ya GPU ntiyashoboye kubikwa."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was removed. Its Cacti device was left in place."
msgstr "Node ya GPU yakuweho. Igikoresho cyayo cya Cacti cyasigaye mu mwanya wacyo."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was not removed because GPU records belong to it. Disable it instead; GPU records are never deleted."
msgstr "Node ya GPU ntiyakuweho kuko hari inyandiko za GPU ziyigize. Ahubwo yihagarike; inyandiko za GPU ntizisibwa na rimwe."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU now belongs to the node it was seen at, with its history."
msgstr "Ubu GPU ibarirwa kuri node yabonetseho, hamwe n'amateka yayo."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU stays with its recorded node."
msgstr "GPU iguma kuri node yanditsweho."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU will leave the data query at the next reindex. Its graphs and RRD files are kept."
msgstr "GPU izava mu ishakisha ry'amakuru mu isubiramo ry'urutonde rukurikira. Ibishushanyo byayo na dosiye za RRD biragumishwa."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Only an absent GPU can be removed from the data query."
msgstr "GPU idahari gusa ni yo ishobora gukurwa mu ishakisha ry'amakuru."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Creating a device needs permission to manage Cacti devices."
msgstr "Kurema igikoresho bisaba uburenganzira bwo gucunga ibikoresho bya Cacti."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Description: enter up to 150 printable characters."
msgstr "Ibisobanuro: injiza ibimenyetso bishobora gucapwa bitarenze 150."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Hostname: enter a host name or IP address."
msgstr "Izina ry'igikoresho (Hostname): injiza izina rya host cyangwa aderesi ya IP."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU Node device template is not installed."
msgstr "Inyandikorugero y'igikoresho cya GPU Node ntiyashyizwemo."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device was not kept: your account may not see devices it creates. Ask an administrator to create it."
msgstr "Igikoresho ntikigumishijweho: konti yawe ntishobora kubona ibikoresho yaremye. Saba umuyobozi kugirema."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be removed after access was refused. Ask an administrator to remove it."
msgstr "Igikoresho nticyashoboye gukurwaho nyuma yo kwimwa uburenganzira. Saba umuyobozi kugikuraho."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device and its GPU node were created. Set the device's SNMP settings on its device page."
msgstr "Igikoresho na node yacyo ya GPU byaremwe. Shyiraho igenamiterere rya SNMP ry'igikoresho ku ipaji y'igikoresho cyacyo."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be created; see the Cacti log."
msgstr "Igikoresho nticyashoboye kuremwa; reba inyandiko-mvugo ya Cacti."

