#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "Saving adds the GPU data query to the device, with Cacti's automatic reindex turned off: the plugin reindexes after every GPU change. Configure the device's SNMP agent first; see docs/node-setup.md."
msgstr "Kubika byongera ishakisha ry'amakuru ya GPU ku gikoresho, isubiramo ry'urutonde rwikora rya Cacti rifunzwe: umugereka usubiramo urutonde nyuma ya buri mpinduka ya GPU. Banza utunganye uhagarariye SNMP w'igikoresho; reba docs/node-setup.md."

