#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "An absent GPU stays an index of the data query, so its graphs and RRD files stay attached and show a gap. Removing it from the data query stops that: at the next reindex Cacti no longer lists it, its graphs stop updating and its data sources show as orphaned, and its RRD files and graphs are kept until you delete them. The GPU record stays, and the GPU returns to the data query if it is reported again."
msgstr "GPU idahari iguma ari umurongo w'ishakisha ry'amakuru, bityo ibishushanyo byayo na dosiye za RRD biguma bifatanye kandi bikerekana icyuho. Kuyikura mu ishakisha ry'amakuru bihagarika ibyo: mu isubiramo ry'urutonde rukurikira Cacti nticyongera kuyishyira ku rutonde, ibishushanyo byayo bihagarika kuvugururwa kandi amasoko y'amakuru yayo agaragara nk'ayasigaye yonyine, na dosiye zayo za RRD n'ibishushanyo biragumishwa kugeza ubisibye. Inyandiko ya GPU iraguma, kandi GPU isubira mu ishakisha ry'amakuru niyongera gutangwaho raporo."

