#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Consecutive successful collections that must miss a GPU before it is marked absent, from 1 to 100. A failed collection, or one that reports no GPUs, never counts. Absent GPUs keep their records and history and are never deleted automatically."
msgstr "Ikusanya ry'amakuru rikurikirana ryagenze neza rigomba kubura GPU mbere y'uko igaragazwa nk'idahari, kuva kuri 1 kugeza ku 100. Ikusanya ryapfuye, cyangwa irigaragaza ko nta GPU zihari, ntiribarwa. GPU zidahari zigumana inyandiko n'amateka yazo kandi ntizigera zisibwa mu buryo bwikora."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "GPU Collection"
msgstr "Ikusanya rya GPU"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Bita agaciro nyuma ya"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds after the tool took a sample that its values stop being graphed, from 60 to 86400. An older value is reported as unknown, so a stopped collection shows as a gap, never as a flat line. The GPU age value keeps counting so it can be alerted on."
msgstr "Amasegonda nyuma y'uko igikoresho gifashe icyitegererezo aho agaciro kacyo kahagarikwa gushyirwa mu gishushanyo, kuva kuri 60 kugeza kuri 86400. Agaciro gashaje kagaragazwa nk'akatazwi, bityo ikusanya ryahagaze rigaragara nk'icyuho, ntirigaragare nk'umurongo urambuye. Agaciro k'igihe GPU imaze itavugururwa gakomeza kubarwa kugira ngo hashobore gutangwa integuza."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Kura muri sisitemu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gumisha imbonerahamwe z'umugereka igihe ukurwa muri sisitemu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its node and GPU records. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export them first from GPU Nodes. Cacti devices, data sources, graphs, and RRD files are never touched either way."
msgstr "Iyo gihiswemo, gukura umugereka muri sisitemu bigumisha inyandiko zayo za nodi na GPU. Gikureho kugira ngo gukura umugereka bizisibe; banza ubisohore uvuye kuri Nodi za GPU. Ibikoresho bya Cacti, amasoko y'amakuru, ibishushanyo, na dosiye za RRD ntibikora na rimwe uko byagenda kose."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Remove the plugin's Cacti objects on uninstall"
msgstr "Siba ibintu bya Cacti by'umugereka mu gihe ukuweho"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin also removes the GPU device template, data query, data template, and graph templates it imported, each only where nothing outside the plugin uses it, and the GPU data query XML it wrote, only if the file is unchanged. It never deletes RRD files, devices, graphs, or data sources; templates those still use are kept."
msgstr "Iyo gihiswemo, gukura umugereka muri sisitemu binasiba icyitegererezo cy'igikoresho cya GPU, ishakisha ry'amakuru, icyitegererezo cy'amakuru, n'ibyitegererezo by'ibishushanyo winjije, buri kimwe gusa aho nta kindi kintu hanze y'umugereka gikikoresha, ndetse na XML y'ishakisha ry'amakuru ya GPU wanditse, gusa niba iyo dosiye itahinduwe. Ntigera isiba dosiye za RRD, ibikoresho, ibishushanyo, cyangwa amasoko y'amakuru; ibyitegererezo bikoreshwa n'ibyo biragumishwa."

